<title>AUSTRALIA: INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries rally seen over-.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT-Australian All Ordinaries rally seen over-.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>extended ------------------------All Ordinaries----------------------</p>
<p>S/Term Range *Res 2540 2560 2600 *RSI-14 70.90 *MA-10 2520.6</p>
<p>2475 - 2540  *Sup 2520 2510 2490 *MA-20 2496.4 *MA-40 2442.1</p>
<p>---------------Analysis by Daniel Fock - May 19-------------</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries in over-extended rally</p>
<p>*Consolidation and retracement seen soon for index</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries overbought in all time frames</p>
<p>*All Ordinaries index closed at 2,358.1 on Friday</p>
<p>The Australian All Ordinaries index has continued higher and and is now over-extended on a technical basis.</p>
